#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:7
msgid "You can customize Mattermost display options based on your preferences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:9
msgid ""
"Using Mattermost in a web browser or the desktop app, select the gear "
"icon |gear| next to your profile picture, then go to **Display**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:47
msgid "Use the Settings icon to customize your Mattermost user experience."
