#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:10
msgid ""
"On the Mattermost mobile app, tap your profile picture, and then tap "
"**Settings > Display**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:13
msgid "Theme"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:17
msgid "Select **Theme** to apply a different look and feel to Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:19
msgid ""
"Select **Theme Colors** to select one of 5 standard themes designed by "
"the Mattermost team. Or, select **Custom Theme** to customize a standard "
"theme even further."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:21
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`customize your theme </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/customize-your-theme>` documentation for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:25
msgid "Tap **Theme** to select one of 5 standard Mattermost themes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:29
msgid ""
"You can define a custom theme using Mattermost in a web browser or the "
"desktop app. See the :doc:`customize your theme </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/customize-your-theme>` documentation for more "
"information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:32
msgid "Threaded discussions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:34
msgid ""
"Threaded discussions offers an enhanced experience for users "
"communicating in threads and replying to messages. Threaded discussions "
"are generally available in Mattermost Cloud and from self-hosted "
"Mattermost v7.0, and are enabled by default for all new Mattermost "
"deployments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:36
msgid ""
"Depending on how your system admin has :ref:`configured threaded "
"discussions <administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-"
"settings:threaded discussions>` for your :doc:`workspace </end-user-guide"
"/end-user-guide-index>`, it may already be enabled for you, or you may be"
" able to enable this feature for your account. See our :doc:`organize "
"conversations using threaded discussions </end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/organize-conversations>` documentation to learn more about working with "
"threaded discussions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:40
msgid "Select **Threaded discussions > Edit** to manage this option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:44
msgid "Tap **Threaded discussions** to manage this option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:47
msgid "Clock display"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:49
msgid "You can customize how time is displayed in Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:53
msgid ""
"Select **Clock Display > Edit** to display time in Mattermost using a "
"12-hour or 24-hour convention."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:57
msgid ""
"Tap **Clock Display** to display time in Mattermost using a 12-hour or "
"24-hour convention."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:60
msgid "Teammate name display"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:62
msgid ""
"You can customize how names are displayed in Mattermost unless your "
"system admin has :ref:`disabled your ability to do so <administration-"
"guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:lock teammate name display "
"for all users>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:66
msgid ""
"Select **Teammate Name Display > Edit** to control how names are "
"displayed in Mattermost. Options include: username, nickname (if it "
"exists), or first and last name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:70
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-options.rst:83
